Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Gravity doubles. Weight follows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.58,0:00:02.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every load becomes twice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:03.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,as heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.41,0:00:04.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Known physics says the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.76,0:00:06.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,mechanism is spacetime curvature
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.11,0:00:07.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,and acceleration under general
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:08.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,relativity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:10.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,The best supported consequence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:11.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,is this: orbits, structures
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:12.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,and biology would respond
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:14.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,to the same changed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.23,0:00:15.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,acceleration.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.59,0:00:16.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,The exact timeline depends
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:17.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,on how the impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:19.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,change occurs.
